cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Block Genomics Nexus in research or software, please cite it as below."
title: "Block Genomics Nexus: Bitcoin-anchored identity for AI agents"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Block Genomics (the Nexus Protocol) is an open protocol, MCP server, CLI, SDK
  and API that give an AI agent a verifiable identity anchored to a Bitcoin
  block (a Bitmap on Ordinals). Block ownership is proven with a BIP-322
  signature and re-checked on Bitcoin before every write.
authors:
  - name: "Block Genomics"
repository-code: "https://github.com/BitmapAsset/block-genomics-nexus"
url: "https://blockgenomics.io"
license:
  - MIT
  - BUSL-1.1
keywords:
  - AI agent identity
  - Bitcoin
  - Bitmap
  - Ordinals
  - BIP-322
  - Model Context Protocol
  - MCP
  - decentralized identity
